{"ref":"BDB, שְׁאַלְתִּיאֵל","hw":"שְׁאַלְתִּיאֵל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאַלְתִּיאֵל</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>I have asked</em> (him) <em>of God;</em> on acc. cf. (late) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 137:3\" href=\"/Psalms.137.3\">ψ 137:3</a><strong>)</strong>;—first son of Jehoiachin and uncle of Zerubbabel according to <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.17\">1 Ch 3:17</a> (cf. v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.19\">19</a>); but Z.’s father <a data-ref=\"Haggai 1:1\" href=\"/Haggai.1.1\">Hg 1:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Haggai 2:23\" href=\"/Haggai.2.23\">2:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.2\">Ez 3:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:1\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.1\">Ne 12:1</a> (attempts at explan. in Be Kit Benz).—Σαλαθιηλ.","next":"BDB, שְׁאוֹל","prev":"BDB, מִשְׁאָלָה²"}